acceptance_criteria: "A budgeted list page emits next_cursor whole in JSON and TOON and with or without --for, and --after with it returns the next rows; Every continuation token in budgeted output (cursor, next_cursor, output_cursor, source_cursor) is exempt from string compaction; A cursor argument shortened by compaction is refused with invalid_query_cursor naming the larger-budget read that returns it whole"
